# Infra

- Single public entry: Caddy `:80` → `gateway-web:3000`; docs routes under `/api/docs/<service>*`.
- `--reset` is `docker compose down -v --remove-orphans`. Full `docker system prune` is `--reset --prune` only (destructive, machine-wide).
- Public catalog/content APIs are proxied at `/api/catalog*` and `/api/content*` (docs stay under `/api/docs/<service>*`).
- Env profiles live in `env/*.env.example`. Do not commit real `env/local-stack.env`.
- Image builds: Kotlin services `bootJar` on the host then `COPY` onto `eclipse-temurin:21-jre`. Gateway and Caddy still build in Docker.
- CI: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` — per-service `./gradlew check` (tests + Spotless), frontend `lint` + `build`, images via host `bootJar` then `docker build`.
